"called, the resulting computed indicator values are returned as a `Pandas"
" Series "
"<https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.Series.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"正如您所看到的，``Indicator`` 实例是 ``Callable`` 的。调用后，计算出的指标值将作为 `Pandas Series "
"<https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.Series.html>`__ 返回。"

